   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRELAND  WHO  LEBANON RESPONSE APPEAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Contribution to the WHO Lebanon Emergency Response flash appeal , targeting &#xa0;conflict affected populations in Lebanon &#xa0;with objective of supporting Humanitarian health needs in Lebanon &#xa0;through the WHO Lebanon Office,&#xa0;the appeal will support large scale response to health accross four areas:&#xa0;life-saving trauma and emergency care continuity of essential health care; disease surveillance and outbreak control; leadership and coordination, as part of the&#xa0;on-going preparedness and response measures with a strong operational focus on trauma response and accelerated training in trauma care for health care workers.</narrative>
  </description>
